    exampleSteps: ["Use the Taylor coefficient rule f⁽ᵏ⁾(0)/k!: the first four coefficients are 1, 1, 1/2, and 1/6.", "Write P₃(x)=1+x+x²/2+x³/6.", "Substitute x=0.2: 1+0.2+0.04/2+0.008/6=1.221333…. ", "Round the polynomial value to 1.2213. It approximates e⁰·²; a separate remainder estimate is needed to bound its error."],
